The PNG images in Finder.iconset are rendered with rsvg-convert, at
each size of the iconset, from places/folder in the Adwaita
icon theme (adwaita-icon-theme 51.0, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme)
by the GNOME Project, https://www.gnome.org.

